> 4 sandestins <-------------- ugh, and who the hell are those?

You rarely see those. They are shape changers (like chameleons).
Chameleons usually appear as normal monsters, while sandestins are
demons that normally take on the shape of "big" monsters. There are also
the doppelgangers, who tend to appear as humans.

The second reason why you won't have noticed them is that they, being
demons, don't leave corpses.

> 13 air elementals <--------- are those the nastiest monsters in the
>                              game?

Not when you meet them in the main dungeon: liches and mind flayers are
much more annoying. The latter two (although they hit less often) can do
much more damaging things. The disadvantage of the elementals is that
you cannot genocide them.

Out of the main dungeon, on the plane of air, they *are* nasty. I
believe they last twice as long there.

